<Layout title="Subscribe to ATHENA | News and perspectives" description="Subscribe to ATHENA’s Substack newsletter for reporting and perspectives on women and children." showNewsletter={false}><section class="text-page"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR ATHENA</p><h1>A place in your day.</h1><p class="standfirst">Choose how you want to follow ATHENA.</p><h2>Every website story</h2><p>Add <a href="/feed.xml">ATHENA’s news feed</a> to your RSS reader to follow stories as they appear on this website. No account is needed. Your feed reader controls notifications.</p><h2>Email newsletter</h2><p>Substack emails you editions sent through the newsletter. Publishing a story on this website alone does not send an email.</p><p>Your newsletter subscription is separate from your <a href="/account">ATHENA reader account</a>.</p><p>If the signup form below does not load, <a href="https://substack.com/@athenawomennews">open ATHENA’s Substack profile</a> and select <strong>Subscribe</strong>.</p></section><Newsletter /></Layout>
